{"availability":"available","full":"haidarrais/laravel-share","name":"laravel-share","description":"Artisan Share monorepo - Laravel artisan webhook tunnel (PHP package) plus Rust relay-server and tunnel-client.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-01T04:10:16Z","updated":"2026-08-01T17:41:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://haidarrais.github.io/laravel-share/","topics":["demo","local-sharing","tunnel-client","webhook"],"demo":"https://haidarrais.github.io/laravel-share/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:35.377Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:35.377Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:35.377Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:32.779Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:02:19.910Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:00:35.377Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Zero-config webhook tunnels for Laravel. Share a local endpoint with a public URL via a driver you own — a self-hosted relay, your own Cloudflare account, or any SSH host you already have.","This project is software only. It operates no shared relay, no backend, and no \"artisan-share.com\" service. Every public endpoint is deployed and owned by the person using it. There is nothing to sign up for."],"features":["One command, zero config. php artisan share reads your app's port,","starts the tunnel, and prints a public HTTPS URL.","Bring-your-own drivers. relay (self-host the project's reference","server), cloudflare (wraps your own cloudflared), and ssh (classic reverse tunnel). All terminate on infrastructure you own.","Webhook-aware logging. Pretty-printed bodies, provider detection from"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/haidarrais/laravel-share/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ad8e9b56384c471f2207eb59cb44eafee61c0ba9d95edec7671c7cdc71d6dce9","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:32.965Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-